# CODEOWNERS - R132 GitHub Flow 强制 review 规则
# GitHub 自动给 PR 分配 reviewer, 修改这些路径的文件 PR 必须 review 通过才能 merge.
#
# 格式: <path>    <@owner>
#  路径支持 * 通配,  @owner 是 GitHub username/team
#  文档: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# 当前 repo owner: @CRLCRL00
# 建议加 2nd reviewer: 团队成员 / 外部 reviewer

# === 全局默认: backend / mini-program 改任何代码需要 owner review ===
/backend/**              @CRLCRL00
/mini-program/**         @CRLCRL00
/.github/workflows/      @CRLCRL00

# === 高敏感路径: 部署 / 数据库 / 安全 ===
/backend/db/migrations/  @CRLCRL00
/backend/.env.example   @CRLCRL00
/.github/workflows/emergency-deploy.yml  @CRLCRL00
/.github/workflows/deploy.yml            @CRLCRL00
/backend/src/config/    @CRLCRL00
/backend/src/middleware/auth.js          @CRLCRL00
/backend/src/middleware/adminAuth.js     @CRLCRL00

# === docs / README 可宽松 review ===
/docs/                   @CRLCRL00
/*.md                    @CRLCRL00
/devlog/                 @CRLCRL00

# === 最后一行兜底: 任何路径都要 owner review ===
# (注释掉这条避免 noise — 上面已分类)
/*                       @CRLCRL00